{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_015jWNnwpPTvq8hSQ6H2bMD8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Summary\n\nI've successfully completed the FIX phase for attempt 12 on \"The Masque of the Red Death.\"\n\n### Root Cause Identified\n\nAfter 11 failed attempts, the true issue was finally discovered:\n\n**The death scene where both characters appear is 221 characters long**, but the context window was only 200 characters. This meant the death detection logic couldn't see both \"Prince Prospero\" and \"the mummer\" in the same context, so it failed to block the merge.\n\n### The Fix\n\n**File:** `src/agents/config.py:72`\n**Change:** Increased `character_mention_context_chars` from 200 → 250\n**Rationale:** Need 250 chars to capture the full death scene with a safety margin\n\n### Smoke Test Results\n\n✅ **PASS** - The fix works!\n\n**Before:** \n- 1 character: \"the Prince Prospero\" with aliases [\"Prospero\", \"the mummer\"]\n\n**After:**\n- 3 characters:\n  - \"the Prince Prospero\" (aka Prospero) ✅\n  - \"the mummer\" - NOW A SEPARATE CHARACTER! ✅\n  - \"Heroded\" (minor false positive)\n\n### Why 11 Attempts Failed\n\nAll previous attempts were **correct in principle**:\n- Attempts 1-10: Built death/confrontation detection logic (this code WORKS!)\n- Attempt 11: Increased context window to 200 (RIGHT direction, but not far enough)\n\nThe issue was that the death scene is 221 chars, so 200 was insufficient. The fix needed just 50 more characters.\n\n### Files Modified\n\n1. `src/agents/config.py` - Increased context window 200 → 250\n2. `EVALUATION_STATE.md` - Documented root cause, fix, and smoke test results\n\n### Next Step\n\nThe phase is now set to `awaiting_analysis`. The loop will re-run the full analysis pipeline to verify the fix resolves the character merge issue and improves the overall score above 8.0."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":312,"cache_read_input_tokens":95772,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":312,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7fe6b989-b18f-4021-8711-3f849a1bf650","uuid":"4c8c36f3-40ef-4691-8f55-763140979cd5"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":456674,"duration_api_ms":337974,"num_turns":46,"result":"## Summary\n\nI've successfully completed the FIX phase for attempt 12 on \"The Masque of the Red Death.\"\n\n### Root Cause Identified\n\nAfter 11 failed attempts, the true issue was finally discovered:\n\n**The death scene where both characters appear is 221 characters long**, but the context window was only 200 characters. This meant the death detection logic couldn't see both \"Prince Prospero\" and \"the mummer\" in the same context, so it failed to block the merge.\n\n### The Fix\n\n**File:** `src/agents/config.py:72`\n**Change:** Increased `character_mention_context_chars` from 200 → 250\n**Rationale:** Need 250 chars to capture the full death scene with a safety margin\n\n### Smoke Test Results\n\n✅ **PASS** - The fix works!\n\n**Before:** \n- 1 character: \"the Prince Prospero\" with aliases [\"Prospero\", \"the mummer\"]\n\n**After:**\n- 3 characters:\n  - \"the Prince Prospero\" (aka Prospero) ✅\n  - \"the mummer\" - NOW A SEPARATE CHARACTER! ✅\n  - \"Heroded\" (minor false positive)\n\n### Why 11 Attempts Failed\n\nAll previous attempts were **correct in principle**:\n- Attempts 1-10: Built death/confrontation detection logic (this code WORKS!)\n- Attempt 11: Increased context window to 200 (RIGHT direction, but not far enough)\n\nThe issue was that the death scene is 221 chars, so 200 was insufficient. The fix needed just 50 more characters.\n\n### Files Modified\n\n1. `src/agents/config.py` - Increased context window 200 → 250\n2. `EVALUATION_STATE.md` - Documented root cause, fix, and smoke test results\n\n### Next Step\n\nThe phase is now set to `awaiting_analysis`. The loop will re-run the full analysis pipeline to verify the fix resolves the character merge issue and improves the overall score above 8.0.","session_id":"7fe6b989-b18f-4021-8711-3f849a1bf650","total_cost_usd":1.5183511999999997,"usage":{"input_tokens":76,"cache_